# Manual Reply Protocol

Use numbered options **only when intent is genuinely ambiguous** — not for workflow approval.

**Safe suggestions:** plain-language option text.

**Never include:** slash commands, mode names, routing arrows.

Users may reply with number or option text.

Example (ambiguous fix vs explore):
1. Diagnose the bug first
2. Explore the codebase area first

Do not use this protocol to gate execution when one workflow clearly fits.
